# Student Learning Tools

<div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:20px;">

<img 
src="https://images.code.org/b396acf416fce1cc693fa94b6ff4e452-image-1779211765174.26.23 AM.png" 
alt="AI Chat Lab icon" 
style="width:60px; height:60px; border-radius:12px;">

<h2 style="margin:0;">
AI Chat Lab
</h2>

</div>

</div>

Throughout Thinking Critically About AI, students interact with AI systems directly through **AI Chat Lab**.

Code.org created AI Chat Lab specifically for classroom use so students can safely explore generative AI tools without needing external accounts or leaving the platform. Students use AI Chat Lab throughout the unit to:
- generate and revise text
- create AI-generated images
- test prompts
- collect evidence
- investigate how AI systems behave

Students repeatedly experiment with how changing prompts affects AI outputs, helping them build a deeper understanding of how AI systems generate responses and where those systems can succeed or fail.

## Student Safety

To support safe and appropriate use, students encounter a reminder message before entering AI Chat Lab:

<div style="background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #000000; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; width: 70%; margin: 20px auto; border: 4px solid #000000; box-shadow: 4px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); position: relative;">
    
    <!-- Close Button -->
    <span style="position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 10px; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; border: 2px solid black; border-radius: 2px; padding: 0 10px; cursor: pointer; line-height: 1;">X</span>
    
<p><b>Remember to chat responsibly!</b></p>

<div style="border-top: 2px solid #000000; margin: 12px 0px;"></div>

<div style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 10px;">
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>All messages you send will be visible to your teacher, including blocked messages.</b></p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Inappropriate messages will be flagged by our content moderation policy.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">All unsaved changes will be lost.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">In order to protect your privacy, anything considered personal information (name, phone number, address, etc.) should not be submitted.</p>
    </div>

<div style="border-top: 2px solid #000000; margin: 12px 0px;"></div>

<!-- Start Chatting Button -->
<div align="right">
  <a href="#start" style="background-color: #8148B2; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 12pt; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block;">
    Start Chatting
  </a>
</div>

</div>

Teachers can use AI Chat Lab as an opportunity to reinforce responsible AI habits, including verification, safe sharing practices, thoughtful prompt writing, and critical evaluation of both text and image outputs.

<div style="clear: both;"></div>

**Up Next:** Try chatting in an AI Chat Lab level!
